      "message": "Inside `setBroadcastTimers` there is check:\n```\nif (audio_state_ \u003d\u003d AudioState::SUSPENDED) {\n```\nNevertheless, when broadcast is started timers will be set if there was no `onAudioResume`. It has to be right that because we want to destroy BIG and disable broadcast at all if there is no sound.\n\nIn next round:\n```\n* broadcstStarted \u003e onAudioResume \u003e\n* onAudioPaused \u003e BIG destroyed \u003e\n* onAudioResume \u003e BIG created \u003e BroadcastStateMachine::State::STREAMING\n```\nthey will not start because of that check inside",
